The points is a list of 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2, and 2, 0.
The count is 5.
The best is 0.
For every first from 0 to count minus 1.
For every second from first plus 1 to count minus 1.
For every third from second plus 1 to count minus 1.
The left is item (second times 2) of points minus item (first times 2) of points.
The upper is item (second times 2 plus 1) of points minus item (first times 2 plus 1) of points.
The right is item (third times 2) of points minus item (first times 2) of points.
The lower is item (third times 2 plus 1) of points minus item (first times 2 plus 1) of points.
The cross is left times lower minus upper times right.
If cross is less than 0, set cross to 0 minus cross.
If cross is more than best, set best to cross.

The area is best as a decimal divided by 2.0.
Report area.
